WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:09.410
Who is that?

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.850
Who are you?

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.360
You're finally awake?

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.800
Why were you sleeping for so long?

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.060
What?

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:42.600
Fine. I'll explain it to you, so listen up.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.110
Who are you?

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:26.740
"Engage"

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:25.970
Onyx says her fever and medication is causing temporary memory loss.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:28.420
So she'll return to normal?

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:30.620
Yes, unfortunately.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:35.260
We don't want her going on about Kisaragi Ryuji.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.050
Onyx has nearly recovered.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:41.700
Let's take her to Albania before her memory is restored.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.400
Nothing will cure her faster than being at home.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:48.390
Contact the airport. We leave Japan tomorrow.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:54.710
I see.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:02.300
Onyx broke into your place and read your books.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.250
Yes.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:05.910
I'm surprised he didn't get caught.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:10.930
Onyx lived in our country when he was young...

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:12.680
so he is familiar with the place.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:16.810
Which means you're an old friend of Onyx's.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:17.650
Who are you?

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:19.100
I am Bianca.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.520
Don't mind me. Keep talking.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:30.110
When he broke in, Onyx searched literature on red dragons.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:32.990
He has not given Rose up yet.

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:35.350
We know.

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:39.740
He gave Ryuji a lengthy explanation before he left.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:42.390
Explanation? What sort of...

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:43.800
That's enough.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.970
I need to get ready for dinner.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.580
Eriko-san, what would you like to eat?

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.820
I'm going shopping.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.590
Ryuji.

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.400
Ryuji.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:09.530
I am not finished talking. Please wait...

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:12.880
Are you okay?

00:04:14.210 --> 00:04:15.330
Does it hurt?

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.380
I think you twisted it a little.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:23.960
Here.

00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:30.630
Allow me to continue.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:38.290
There's more to dragons than meets the eye.

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.280
Why don't you go after him?

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.840
I want Ryuji-kun to make his own decision.

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:49.840
Whether he's right or wrong, he has to decide for himself.

00:04:51.050 --> 00:04:52.270
I see.

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:59.750
If he chooses to live a normal life, what will you do?

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.420
That would be fine.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.600
Maybe I'll go back to America.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.770
Onyx said that to you?

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:18.020
Fool. You don't have a choice.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.010
I'm just a kid.

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:26.360
I'm a kid who couldn't help Rose when she was in pain.

00:05:27.830 --> 00:05:30.760
No, even that would be better.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:33.560
I'm the one who hurt Rose.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:37.900
I made her suffer with the power of the Lost Precious.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.520
It's my fault.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.190
It's my fault that happened to Rose.

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:50.070
There is nothing of that description in my kingdom's library.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:55.670
Perhaps it was a lie to push you away from Rose.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:58.500
But Rose actually had a fever...

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.620
What does it matter?

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:08.240
Perhaps the cross-species ritual caused her emotions to affect her physically.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:13.020
Onyx wishes to engage with Rose.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.970
There is no need to believe him.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.590
But if...

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:17.760
Enough!

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:21.840
Who do you believe, me or Onyx?

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.740
You.

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.230
Very good.

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:37.100
Black dragons desire to gain the power of red dragons.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:39.630
Why have I changed?

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:43.080
As a user of the Slash Breath...

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:48.770
you must have a response to adult dragons.

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:55.610
I believe you simply have feelings for her.

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:06.130
Ryuji, I believe you and Rose represent a new possibility for human-dragon relations.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:11.300
My uncle tried and failed.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.190
You must decide...

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:19.570
whether you will make dragons your enemies or your friends.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.600
Answer me.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:31.450
What sort of relationship do you desire with us dragons?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:36.880
What sort of relationship do you desire with Rose?

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:52.860
Then you should have said so in the first place.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.320
Sorry.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:55.990
Lend me your back.

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:59.980
I will allow you to carry me.

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:11.880
What is this?

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:14.990
Sapphie?

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.630
I'm home.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.010
"Tomorrow Haneda 20 10"

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.240
Make the arrangements.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:40.240
We'll meet at Haneda. I'll pick up Maruga.

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.380
Ryuji-kun.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.440
I'll be back.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.290
This is Tokura.

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:04.060
So much for tension.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:05.600
Please excuse me.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.180
The flight you asked about isn't in the flight plan.

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:11.970
It must be Fang's private jet.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:14.680
Fleeing the country on a private jet?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:17.000
They're enemies of the common people.

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.120
We'll be arriving in Gjirokastër.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:33.000
We'll be heading to Rose's home immediately, so prepare a guide.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:49.860
Who...

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:56.090
are you?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.390
Rose!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.720
You still haven't regained your memory?

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:11.550
This plane's about to leave!

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:13.290
What's wrong with that?

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:14.990
Onyx!

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:18.080
Good to see you again, Sapphie.

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.750
I hope you're not causing trouble again.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:24.700
Ow, that hurts.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.000
Hello, Rose.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.520
Sapphie, bring her something.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.630
Something that will wake her up.

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:43.650
We will take off shortly.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.890
You've been through a lot.

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:57.110
But you're safe now.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.060
I'll live with you in your homeland.

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.910
It's for the best.

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.360
Ony...

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.190
We will be taking off soon.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.180
Maruga!

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:31.530
Control deck!

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:33.030
We'll make an emergency stop!

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:35.190
Ignore her. Just go.

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.750
How appalling.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.550
Is that how you greet a childhood friend?

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.550
Regain control and take off.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:12:00.590
I would like to apologize to our customers.

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:05.150
Today's flights have been completely sold out.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:09.700
This airport will be used for special flights for society members.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:16.090
For those of you in a hurry, please use Narita Airport instead.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:22.010
Surround them!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:29.630
Your current sponsor is Seven Tails' Nanao Eriko-san!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.300
Let's give her a hand!

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.640
Hi!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:38.890
I've contributed most of my funds to this, so the rest is up to you, Ryuji-kun!

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:40.070
Got it!

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:44.040
The adjacent runway hasn't been frozen. Use that one to take off.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.420
Roger that.

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:58.520
Damn it!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.000
Captain!

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:13.870
I won't let you go!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.410
Let's hurry!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:41.200
Well, well. They couldn't just let us go.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.110
Kai.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:43.190
Yes, sir.

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:50.000
This is your last chance to remember.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:53.190
Are you willing to leave the man you love?

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:55.550
Come on!

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:03.440
Give yourselves up.

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:06.950
Yo.

00:14:09.150 --> 00:14:10.570
Forehead flick.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:18.960
We've met before, haven't we?

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.720
Oh, that's right.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:25.830
I owe you for what you did to me at the radio tower.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:27.690
This is payback.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.120
Misaki told me everything.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:38.090
You're keeping secrets. Why didn't you tell me, Ryuji?

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:41.170
This isn't Ryuji!

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:49.330
Ryuji!

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:53.190
Ai, what are you doing here?

00:14:53.930 --> 00:14:55.040
Let's go!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.580
Okay.

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.860
Eat this.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.130
Come on.

00:15:08.350 --> 00:15:11.790
I know this flavor.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.140
Hang on, you two!

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:25.500
Genmu, Kocho!

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:26.800
Kocho!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.000
Kocho!

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:31.420
Onyx!

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:42.500
This is ice cream.

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:48.370
Rose!

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.360
Ryuji.

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:00.140
Ryuji!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.660
Are you afraid of me?

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:11.830
No, my chest hurts.

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:15.410
I know. You don't need to force yourself.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.520
But...

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.300
I don't want this.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:30.230
If I can't be with Ryuji, I don't want to grow up.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:35.310
I want to be a child again.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.440
You can't.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.530
We all have to grow up eventually.

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:46.580
You have to decide for yourself what you will do one day.

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:48.410
Ryuji?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:52.380
Until now, I wanted to protect you.

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:55.440
I think I was treating you like a child.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.880
But if you've become an adult before me...

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.630
then I want to become an adult, too.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:05.140
I want to grow up with you.

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.860
I want to be with you.

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:12.140
Let's plan our futures together.

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:16.310
Rose, I love you.

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.400
Onyx!

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:37.230
Stop, Onyx! Do you intend to take us there like this?

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.790
Onyx, don't do this!

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:52.400
Don't you dare hurt our son.

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:55.450
Even if you are a dragon.

00:17:59.350 --> 00:18:01.150
Hold on, everyone!

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:11.010
Love engage.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.540
Onyx!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:26.420
Onyx!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.500
What is this?

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.410
It's amazing!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:43.690
Fascinating! You truly are fascinating!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.680
See you later.

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:52.570
Shall we go?

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:53.590
Yes.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.660
Excuse me...

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:00.350
Could I get your autograph?

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:08.820
Due to technical difficulties, this airport will be closed temporarily.

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:10.630
Thank you for your understanding.

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:26.610
What happened at the end?

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:31.510
Their high level engage must have expended their energy.

00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:40.480
Well, I can say for certain it won't be easy from here on out.

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:40.480
They kissed... they kissed... they kissed...

00:19:46.380 --> 00:19:48.300
Ryuji!

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:51.930
What happened after my miracle relationship advice?

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:55.260
My question box is always open!

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:57.530
What's wrong with you?

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:57.530
Oh, that?

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.210
It worked out. Don't worry about it.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:05.690
"It worked out"? Give me a report on the specifics!

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.010
Aren't you curious?

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:10.970
I can't say I'm not, but...

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:14.590
I'm just glad Ryuji-kun is back.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:17.270
I see.

00:20:18.340 --> 00:20:20.830
"Plan to Take Kisaragi Ryuji"

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:20.900
But we're going ahead with this!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:24.460
Plans to Take Kisaragi Ryuji numbers one through sixteen!

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:29.210
Your battle is just beginning!

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:30.120
Ryuji!

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:37.010
I got it braided.

00:20:37.330 --> 00:20:40.820
All her struggling made it a real hassle.

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.580
You're still here?

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:45.290
Of course.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:49.020
I'll follow you around until Onyx comes back.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:51.160
I live to love.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.530
Excuse me, but who are you?

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:54.820
What's that about love?

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:58.380
You don't even go to this school! Not to mention this is the fourth floor!

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:01.020
Sounds rather interesting.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.800
She's not even from this country.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.180
What are you doing here, Eriko-san?

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:09.900
Ryuji, I got your parents' autographs! Look!

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:18.990
Come on, take your seats.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:21.980
A mysterious teacher? She's a beauty, too.

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:23.590
She looks familiar.

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.640
I will take roll...

00:21:39.640 --> 00:21:42.970
Humans and dragons coexisting.

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:44.870
Truly fascinating.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.720
"Dragon Crisis!"
